    "massive_review_section": {
      "type": "pm-bs-massive-review",
      "blocks": {
        "review_en_01": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Honestly, I was surprised by how good this one is. The quality is impressive, the scent lasts for hours and it's incredibly close to the original. If no one had told me, I never would have noticed a difference. What makes it even better is the price. Getting perfume this good without paying for the luxury brand feels completely fair. Totally worth it, and I'll be ordering again.\"</p>",
            "author": "Luciana R.",
            "date": "7 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_02": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I was pleasantly surprised by the quality of the scents. They last much longer than I expected and the bottles look great too. I've already gotten several compliments while wearing them. Ordering was easy and I'm really happy with my purchase. I'm definitely going to try more scents!\"</p>",
            "author": "Alina M.",
            "date": "4 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_03": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I bought and tried the Jean Paul Gaultier scent. I'm seriously impressed!! The scent is spot on and it lasts all day. I have 55 different original fragrances in my collection, but none of them can compete with this one. Wow.\"</p>",
            "author": "Steen J.",
            "date": "6 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_04": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I was surprised by how long the perfumes last, I didn't expect that at this price. I put it on in the morning, and when I take my shirt off in the evening I can still smell it. Recommended if you're looking for alternatives to luxury perfumes.\"</p>",
            "author": "Maria F.",
            "date": "5 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_05": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I was really surprised by how good the perfume is, and it lasts well. I've ordered twice so far and I'll be back when I run out 😀\"</p>",
            "author": "Pernille O.",
            "date": "5 months ago",
            "rating": 4,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_06": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"The quality of the scent pleasantly surprised me. It smells very similar to luxury perfumes but costs much less. It lasts a long time and feels elegant, I really enjoy wearing it every day. A great alternative if you love high-end fragrances but don't want to pay the high prices.\"</p>",
            "author": "Tetiana H.",
            "date": "7 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_07": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I've worn Acqua di Giò for years and this one captures exactly the same fresh ocean feel. Crisp citrus, salty marine notes and a woody base. Honestly, I can't tell the difference. Best part? The price. Now I can finally spray as much as I want without worrying.\"</p>",
            "author": "Michael D.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_08": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I was honestly really surprised by how good this perfume is. The scent is well balanced, soft and long-lasting without being too strong. It has a clean, elegant feel that works for everyday and for dressier occasions. I also noticed it develops nicely after a while, which makes it even more fun to wear. All in all I'm really happy, and I'd gladly recommend it to anyone looking for something unique and high quality.\"</p>",
            "author": "Zein H.",
            "date": "7 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_09": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"My date genuinely thought it was Tom Ford. It even lasts maybe an hour or two longer, which is incredible, especially at this price.\"</p>",
            "author": "Nick D.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_10": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Lasts longer than I expected. It holds a steady 6 to 7 hours on me, which is better than the original in my case. Just the right projection, neither too strong nor too weak.\"</p>",
            "author": "Peter S.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 4,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_11": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I absolutely loved my scent! I tried the one inspired by YSL Libre, and I actually liked it a lot more than the original from YSL!\"</p>",
            "author": "A'Miracle F.",
            "date": "9 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_12": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"A real find! Side by side with Imagination there's barely any difference, and everyone else just says “damn, you smell good.” Wish I'd found this sooner!!!\"</p>",
            "author": "Eric M.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_13": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I'm sooooo happy with everything, the scents are amazing and very close to the originals. They last a really long time!\"</p>",
            "author": "Lena A.",
            "date": "4 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_14": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I was looking for a specific perfume and got help finding it. It was exactly what I wanted and it lasts over 12 hours! I get nothing but compliments. Thank you!\"</p>",
            "author": "Rozhin D.",
            "date": "2 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_15": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"A little goes a long way. The first time I sprayed way too much, this one is strong! Now I stick to two sprays max and it lasts all day. The cinnamon and amber make it cozy but still grown-up.\"</p>",
            "author": "Kevin O.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 4,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_16": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I've loved Black Opium for years and this one is honestly almost identical. Love the warm notes of vanilla and coffee. It's cozy but still feels sophisticated.\"</p>",
            "author": "Emily C.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_17": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I've bought perfume for both myself and my wife and they smell really good. Just like the scents they're inspired by. Recommended.\"</p>",
            "author": "Mattias E.",
            "date": "2 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_18": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"It smells exactly like the original. The rose feels fresh and natural, and the longevity is amazing, easily over 12 hours.\"</p>",
            "author": "Kiara B.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_19": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Wonderful, honest company. RECOMMENDED 10/10, really nice perfumes that smell just like the original, and genuinely fair prices. I've ordered twice.\"</p>",
            "author": "Ayham A.",
            "date": "2 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_20": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"A great pick for oud lovers. If you like deep, woody scents with spice and warmth, this one hits the mark. Not exactly like Alexandria II, but a really good alternative.\"</p>",
            "author": "Jason C.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 4,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_21": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Really good quality perfumes at a low price!! I'm definitely ordering more. I sprayed once on my arm just to test it and could smell it for hours!!!! Really good service. Recommend!!\"</p>",
            "author": "Julia P.",
            "date": "3 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_22": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Smells incredibly close to the original, L'Immensité by Louis Vuitton. Fresh citrus and ginger blend perfectly with subtle herbal notes. Highly recommended.\"</p>",
            "author": "John M.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_23": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Not just for men. I'm a girl and I was worried it would be too masculine, but it's actually perfect. The amber softens the leather and the cinnamon makes it interesting.\"</p>",
            "author": "Priya S.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_24": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I've ordered several times and I'm super happy! Good quality, made so you know what's in it, and the scent lasts for hours!\"</p>",
            "author": "René V.",
            "date": "4 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_25": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"It's my go-to on nights when I stay in and just want to treat myself. The warmth and sweetness make it so cozy.\"</p>",
            "author": "Emily S.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 4,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_26": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I ordered two perfumes and I'm really impressed. The scents are very close to the originals and the quality exceeded my expectations. The service was fast and professional too. I'm very happy with my purchase and I'd happily recommend you to others. Thank you for a fantastic experience.\"</p>",
            "author": "Amran T.",
            "date": "3 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_27": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I've worn L'Eau d'Issey before and this one nails it. The woody notes and the citrus are spot on, and it lasts just as long.\"</p>",
            "author": "Brian O.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_28": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"This is my second order! Great perfumes that smell good and last long. My favorite is the cherry one, it smells amazing!\"</p>",
            "author": "Tina H.",
            "date": "2 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_29": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Spot on. Is this even legal? As close to the original as you can get. The scent lasts long and ordering barely hurts the wallet. Highly recommended! 👍🏻\"</p>",
            "author": "Håcan A.",
            "date": "6 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_30": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I work late nights and needed something to freshen up with before heading out. This one does the trick: clean, not overpowering, and it lasts.\"</p>",
            "author": "Malik J.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 4,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_31": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Love the perfumes, they smell like the originals and last long 😍 I've ordered 10 perfumes and I love them all.\"</p>",
            "author": "Christina T.",
            "date": "4 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_32": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I was honestly surprised by how luxurious this smells. It lasts longer than most designer fragrances I've tried, and I've saved a ton of money.\"</p>",
            "author": "Adam G.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_33": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"The perfumes are really good! There's almost no difference from the originals and I'm honestly really happy with my purchase. Great price.\"</p>",
            "author": "Rimuska B.",
            "date": "2 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_34": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Unlike some other alternatives, this one doesn't smell cheap or chemical. I like the blend and it stays on my clothes for a long time.\"</p>",
            "author": "Claire H.",
            "date": "1 year ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_35": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"The scent really surprised me, it's absolutely outstanding! I love it, and the packaging is very elegant too.\"</p>",
            "author": "Silvana R.",
            "date": "6 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "review_en_36": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I loved this perfume, the scent is incredible and it lasts a long time. Honestly, it's a smart choice at a low price and I'll definitely buy it again. I'm completely in love 😍❤️\"</p>",
            "author": "Daniela B.",
